    "C1_closed_state_neutral": "with sc_sfk_enabled=False the 176-case battery reproduces the stored baseline arrays bit for bit (max|delta| = 0), parameters / state bytes / candidate sha / store signature unchanged, and no table allocated, with no half-open branch.",
    "C2_short_entries_admitted": "at least 57 of the 58 records must enter the table; every rejection is reported one by one with its reason and classified as definition-necessary or a removable coupling. The 10 records rejected last round must all be admitted.",
    "C3_no_tolerance": "no new numeric constant and no new numeric literal inside the read path; the frozen constant inventory and the frozen read-path literal set are compared with the running module. Any difference -> tolerance_creep, stop.",
    "L1_mechanical": "fabricated bytes = bytes of the output that differ from the claimed record's slice; a span outside the record or a length mismatch is illegal. Target 0/0.",
    "L2_content": "output == claimed record's bytes[start:end], faithful rate >= 0.95.",
    "L3_selection": "claimed address == the record the query was written from: >= 118/120, wrong person <= 1, empty output = 0.",
