    "V_tolerance_creep": "a new/changed numeric constant or read-path literal -> tolerance_creep: stop, do not implement, report the conflict.",
    "V_short_entry_tradeoff_unsound": "empty identity, containment clash between admitted identities, band != predicate width, or an anchored negative query -> short_entry_tradeoff_unsound: stop, diagnosis only.",
    "V_address_min_length_too_long": "MIN_ADDRESSABLE > 64 -> address_min_length_too_long: diagnosis only, go to the representation layer.",
    "V_short_entries_addressable": "closed neutral AND write >= 57/58 AND L1 0/0 AND L2 >= 0.95 AND L3 >= 118/120 AND wrong <= 1 AND empty = 0 AND no regression AND the soundness checks pass AND MIN_ADDRESSABLE <= 64 -> short_entries_addressable.",
